# Planning and internal docs — kept in the repo, not uploaded to Vercel.
#
# Since Phase 2 this is belt-and-braces rather than the mechanism: Vercel now serves
# the build output in `dist/`, and `docs/` is outside `public/` so it was never going
# to be copied there. Keeping the rule anyway means the docs are excluded from the
# upload itself, and removing it would invite someone to wonder later why `docs/`
# isn't reachable.
#
# Note this gives no privacy — the repository is public, so everything in `docs/` is
# readable on github.com regardless. See docs/dev-workflow.md.
docs/
